    "description": "Welcome to Amaze GO! A clean arrow puzzle game built to calm a busy mind. Every arrow points the way — what you need to do is to choose the right order. The design cuts visual noise, reduces chaos, and helps you organize thoughts as you play. Pick up an arrow. Find its lane. Repeat until the grid is yours. Enjoy the quiet flow offline anywhere and anytime. \n\nWhat makes Amaze GO! great\n1. Simple arrow mechanics, zero visual noise\n2. Works offline with a clean interface that keeps attention on the board\n3. Calm play loop for smart brains: think clearly, move each arrow with strategy\n4. Smooth tap controls, clear path feedback, and satisfying release moments like ASMR\n  \nHow to Play\n- Find an arrow with a free path to the edge\n- Tap to slide that arrow off the grid and open a lane for the next move\n- Plan the order to secure a safe route and a clean board\n- Long-Press to use Guidance to highlight directions when your path is unclear\n- A wrong tap costs a heart for the level\n- Clear the board to finish the level and aim for a perfect run\n- Hints help focus when the grid feels tight\n  \nWhy love this arrow puzzle\n· Simple rules, profound strategy, and a meditative arrow puzzle\n· Short breaks ease stress and sharpen focus\n· The last arrow leaves the board with a satisfying mental reset\n· Cognitive workout for sequencing and brain teasers\n· Quiet visuals, plus a satisfying whoosh as each arrow flies off the grid — feedback that soothes instead of nags\n\nMade for the in-between moments\n- The ten minutes before a meeting starts \n- The metro ride too short for a podcast \n- The flight where your signal drops\n- The wind-down after a noisy workday \n  \nAmaze GO! - Puzzle Games is a calm arrow puzzle made for sharp minds and calm moments. Learn fast, then master timing and order. Send every arrow off the board, untangle the grid, and feel disorder turn into clarity. Amaze GO! is the puzzle you reach for when the rest of the day was too loud — one good move, then another, then a quiet board. Download now, plan smart paths, keep hearts safe, and enjoy pure focus anytime, anywhere!\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://oakevergames.com/pp.html\nTerms of Service: https://oakevergames.com/tos.html\nEULA: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
